  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "1.1",
      "scene": "s01_problem",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 0.6,
      "duration": 7.2,
      "words": 17,
      "text": "Every day, our minds juggle fleeting conversations: promises made on the fly, technical details, small nagging worries.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_1_1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "1.2",
      "scene": "s01_problem",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 8.2,
      "duration": 6.8,
      "words": 16,
      "text": "Traditional voice assistants are passive: they wait for a wake word and break our natural flow.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_1_2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "1.3",
      "scene": "s01_problem",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 16.0,
      "duration": 7.2,
      "words": 17,
      "text": "Introducing EXAMEN: a second brain that listens in the background, filters the noise, and organizes your day.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_1_3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "2.1",
      "scene": "s02_architecture",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 0.6,
      "duration": 5.7,
      "words": 13,
      "text": "EXAMEN listens through the open-source Bee wearable, streaming every utterance in real time.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_2_1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "2.2",
      "scene": "s02_architecture",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 8.0,
      "duration": 7.2,
      "words": 17,
      "text": "On AWS Bedrock, a Semantic Gatekeeper drops over ninety percent of chatter, for just cents a day.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_2_2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "2.3",
      "scene": "s02_architecture",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 16.0,
      "duration": 7.2,
      "words": 17,
      "text": "Real signal, like a promise or a technical topic, goes to LangGraph on AgentCore and into DynamoDB.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_2_3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "3.1",
      "scene": "s03_live",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 0.6,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "words": 10,
      "text": "Let's try it live. No wake word. I just say:",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_3_1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "3.2",
      "scene": "s03_live",
      "kind": "live",
      "start": 5.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "words": 11,
      "text": "Remind me to contact Danilo and coordinate about the hackathon submission.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/live_3_2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "3.3",
      "scene": "s03_live",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 10.4,
      "duration": 8.8,
      "words": 21,
      "text": "Bee streams it, the Gatekeeper tags it as a task, and the scheduler files it in Daily Routines, linked to Danilo.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_3_3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "3.4",
      "scene": "s03_live",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 19.8,
      "duration": 4.9,
      "words": 11,
      "text": "No typing, no follow-up. It's already there when I need it.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_3_4.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "4.1",
      "scene": "s04_topics",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 0.6,
      "duration": 6.8,
      "words": 16,
      "text": "In meetings, the Event Engine spots technical discussions and builds an executive dossier, organized into chapters.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_4_1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "4.2",
      "scene": "s04_topics",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 10.0,
      "duration": 8.4,
      "words": 20,
      "text": "It runs web research in the background and attaches the official documentation it finds, so every claim has a source.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_4_2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "4.3",
      "scene": "s04_topics",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 21.0,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "words": 15,
      "text": "And the same dossier opens as a touch view, built for Alexa Echo Show displays.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_4_3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "5.1",
      "scene": "s05_social",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 0.6,
      "duration": 8.4,
      "words": 20,
      "text": "The Social Rolodex remembers people and the promises between you, in both directions: what you owe, and what you're owed.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_5_1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "5.2",
      "scene": "s05_social",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 11.0,
      "duration": 11.3,
      "words": 27,
      "text": "Say 'I'll send you the repo docs by 5 PM', and EXAMEN works out who owes what, sets the deadline, and adds the task to your day.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_5_2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "6.1",
      "scene": "s06_peace",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 0.6,
      "duration": 7.2,
      "words": 17,
      "text": "For peace of mind, EXAMEN certifies physical actions with exact timestamps and the words you actually said.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_6_1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "6.2",
      "scene": "s06_peace",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 10.6,
      "duration": 7.2,
      "words": 17,
      "text": "And when it isn't sure who spoke, the item waits in Speaker Review for your one-click confirmation.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_6_2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "7.1",
      "scene": "s07_alexa",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 0.6,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "words": 15,
      "text": "For Alexa+, EXAMEN runs an MCP server on AWS, with twenty-two tools over Streamable HTTP.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_7_1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "7.2",
      "scene": "s07_alexa",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 7.4,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "words": 15,
      "text": "So later I just ask Alexa what's on my plate, and Danilo is right there.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_7_2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "8.1",
      "scene": "s08_closing",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 0.6,
      "duration": 8.8,
      "words": 21,
      "text": "With over 580 automated tests and an ultra-low-cost cloud architecture, EXAMEN turns ambient listening into a partner you can rely on.",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_8_1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "8.2",
      "scene": "s08_closing",
      "kind": "vo",
      "start": 10.0,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "words": 8,
      "text": "EXAMEN: augmented memory for everyday life. Thank you!",
      "file": "voiceover-v2/vo_8_2.wav"
    }
  ]
